Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------

simdjson
--------

The `cpu-simdjson` backend is a thin C wrapper, built from
`json/cpu/simdjson_ffi/simdjson_wrapper.cpp` and distributed as
`lib/libsimdjson_wrapper.so`. The wrapper itself is part of this
project and carries the licence above. It links against simdjson:

    simdjson <https://github.com/simdjson/simdjson>
    Copyright 2018-2025 The simdjson authors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The Apache-2.0 text ships inside the simdjson package itself, at
`info/licenses/LICENSE`, and is available at
<https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0>.

Mojo toolchain
--------------

Building or running this library requires the Mojo toolchain, which
the consumer installs and which this project does not redistribute.
The Mojo compiler and standard library sources are published under the
Apache License 2.0 with LLVM Exceptions, but the `mojo` and
`mojo-compiler` conda packages as distributed today declare
`LicenseRef-Modular-Proprietary` and ship the Modular Community
License Terms in `info/licenses/LICENSE`. The file inside the package
you installed is the one that governs your copy.

MAX
---

The GPU path additionally requires `max-core`, which is governed by the
